  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Manglefeets_protege.jpg\" title=\"Manglefeet's protege at the Arena Gate\"><img alt=\"Manglefeet's protege at the Arena Gate\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"202\" src=\"/images/Manglefeets_protege.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Manglefeets_protege.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Manglefeet's protege at the Arena Gate</div></div></div>\n<p>Manglefeet's protege, a giant <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Melee_Whomper\" title=\"Mutant Melee Whomper\">Mutant Melee Whomper</a> Hero, is the third of the three gatekeepers in the entry way of <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania Massacre</a>.  He guards the Arena Gate which will open when he is killed, allowing access to the Arena and Manglefeet himself.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
